{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition","id":839576,"title":"Onyx Path's Scion 2nd Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-29T18:01:39-08:00","id":839576,"title":"Onyx Path's Scion 2nd Edition","content":"Alright, I've been TRYING to keep up on the updates on Scion 2nd Edition information on the main page, and likely failing horribly as I do a lot of stuff and don't get to check as often as I'd like to. I was just curious, having read some of the possible excerpts as to how far along the game is. A potential ETA until we can smell the freshly printed pages of Scion: Origins and Scion: Hero as we gleefully hold them in our hands?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T18:07:44-08:00","id":839581,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping they leave Power Drinker as a Knack. I want my Drunken Fist Scion!<br /> <br /> Also, from what I just read, it sounds like the Gods won't be sculpted by mortal interpretations of them (something I'm happy with, as it defuncts the Cult of the One God antagonists.), but mortal interpretation will have an influence on how they conduct themselves. Which will be interesting to see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 02-29-2016, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T06:01:00-08:00","id":839835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Dude</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition#post839576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, I've been TRYING to keep up on the updates on Scion 2nd Edition information on the main page, and likely failing horribly as I do a lot of stuff and don't get to check as often as I'd like to. I was just curious, having read some of the possible excerpts as to how far along the game is. A potential ETA until we can smell the freshly printed pages of Scion: Origins and Scion: Hero as we gleefully hold them in our hands?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sometime later this month or next month we'll be putting out the alpha document.<br /> <br /> Later this week it'll have the outline completed, then on to first drafts. I hope this will take no more than three months. After that it goes to playtesting and second drafts, so another three months and the Kickstarter. At the same time we'll have art, and other drafts, and more playtesting, and so on.<br /> <br /> It's my fond, firm desire to have Scion in your hands in some form - PDF, POD, or whatever - this year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T06:01:32-08:00","id":839836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition?p=839581#post839581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm hoping they leave Power Drinker as a Knack. I want my Drunken Fist Scion!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's probably a Warrior Knack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T06:09:07-08:00","id":839841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition?p=839835#post839835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sometime later this month or next month we'll be putting out the alpha document.<br /> <br /> Later this week it'll have the outline completed, then on to first drafts. I hope this will take no more than three months. After that it goes to playtesting and second drafts, so another three months and the Kickstarter. At the same time we'll have art, and other drafts, and more playtesting, and so on.<br /> <br /> It's my fond, firm desire to have Scion in your hands in some form - PDF, POD, or whatever - this year.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This may be a tad late to ask, but I'm curious.<br /> <br /> Will Scion 2E also be split into multiple books like 1E will, or will this book includ Hero, Demigod and God together?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T06:13:57-08:00","id":839843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition?p=839841#post839841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This may be a tad late to ask, but I'm curious.<br /> <br /> Will Scion 2E also be split into multiple books like 1E will, or will this book includ Hero, Demigod and God together?</div> </div> </div> </div>2e's going to have multiple corebooks: Origin (the main rulebook), Hero, Demigod, and God.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-01T08:02:56-08:00","id":839909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/839576-onyx-path-s-scion-2nd-edition?p=839841#post839841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will Scion 2E also be split into multiple books like 1E will, or will this book includ Hero, Demigod and God together?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marin</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">2e's going to have multiple corebooks: Origin (the main rulebook), Hero, Demigod, and God.</div> </div> </div> </div>Marin is correct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>",